  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enterprise Development Programme (EDP) - Ethiopia Core Country Management - 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide technical and advisory supports to partner enterprises. It will also facilitate grants and follow up the proper utilisation the grants transferred. Besides Enterprise Development Programme (EDP) grants, the project will also try to facilitate the establishment of Loan Guarantee Fund arrangements to partner enterprises for accessing working capital finance and follow up the proper utilisation of such investments.</narrative>
  </description>
